  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞将{F4 84 04 01 01 01 BD 07}\n　交给了伊丽莎白。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_330.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 22 01 01 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 DB 0E}……真是出色。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_330.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我已经无话可说了。\n您尽情享受了这场文化祭，\n也变得更加强大……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_330.bf.json:1:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 0D 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E5 10}……我也不能就此止步。\n至少要能赤手空拳\n打败那种Ｆ．Ｏ．Ｅ才行……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_330.bf.json:1:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我封印了所有人格面具和技能，\n还绑住双手双脚，\n试着向它发起了挑战……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_330.bf.json:1:4",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D4 0E}眼看就差最后一点了，\n却实在觉得太麻烦。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_330.bf.json:1:5",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 01 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}要是戴上这件饰品，\n或许还能轻松些……\n但我可不能过于懒惰。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_330.bf.json:1:6",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}所以，这件饰品就转赠给您吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_330.bf.json:1:7",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D1 0E}等遇上更强的敌人时，\n想必能派上用场。\n请您尽管使用。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
